# HVO Roof Controller V4 REST Client Collection
# Requires the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client)

# Usage
# 1. Export an API key before starting VS Code (never paste keys into this file):
#      export ROOF_API_KEY=<operator or admin key>      (see docs/security.md)
# 2. Start the app ("Debug" launch profile binds http://localhost:5195)
# 3. Highlight any request below and use the REST Client "Send Request" action
#
# Roles: Status = Viewer; Open/Close/ClearFault/Lease = Operator; Stop = any key; Configuration and System = Admin.
# Commands are POST; GET returns 405. Failures are ProblemDetails with "code" and "roofStatus" (409 refused by an
# interlock, 503 not ready / relay state unverified, 401 missing key, 403 wrong role).

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5195
@apiVersion = 4.0
@contentType = application/json
@apiKey = {{$processEnv ROOF_API_KEY}}

### Health - Ready (anonymous)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

### Health - details (Viewer; 503 with a JSON body when Unhealthy)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Roof status (Viewer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Status
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Stop roof (any key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Stop
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Open roof (Operator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Open
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Close roof (Operator)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Close
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Renew the operator lease while moving (Operator; 409 LeaseNotActive when idle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Lease
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Clear controller fault (Operator); pulseMs 50-2000, default 250
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/ClearFault?pulseMs=250
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Read configuration (Admin); note "version" for the update below
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Configuration
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Update configuration (Admin)
# Every field is required. expectedVersion must equal the version just read (409 on mismatch). Changing relay ids,
# limit/fault polarity or ignorePhysicalLimitSwitches also needs "confirmSafetyCriticalChange": true.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/RoofControl/Configuration
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "expectedVersion": 1,
  "confirmSafetyCriticalChange": false,
  "safetyWatchdogTimeoutSeconds": 150,
  "openRelayId": 1,
  "closeRelayId": 2,
  "clearFaultRelayId": 3,
  "stopRelayId": 4,
  "enableDigitalInputPolling": true,
  "digitalInputPollIntervalMilliseconds": 25,
  "enablePeriodicVerificationWhileMoving": true,
  "periodicVerificationIntervalSeconds": 1,
  "useNormallyClosedLimitSwitches": true,
  "limitSwitchDebounceMilliseconds": 50,
  "ignorePhysicalLimitSwitches": false,
  "faultInputActiveHigh": true,
  "maxConsecutiveInputReadFailures": 3,
  "operatorLeaseTimeoutSeconds": null,
  "atSpeedConfirmationTimeoutSeconds": null
}

### System information (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/System/info
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Camera stream ticket (Viewer); open the returned relative "url" within 60 s, no header needed
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1.0/Camera/1/ticket
Accept: {{contentType}}
X-Api-Key: {{apiKey}}
